BossBGMEntry(0x49, FE5BossBattleID)
//Chp2
BossBGMEntry(0x4A, FE5BossBattleID)
//Chp3

//Chp4

//Chp5

//Chp6

//Chp7



BossBGMTerminator

PUSH

ORG $72908
POIN BossBGMTable

POP
